==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3~40 seconds<sup>90f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use long ranged cats such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] or [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] along with [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] to stall.

When the battle starts, save up money for Dragon Cat while stalling the Owlbrow with Macho and/or Wall. Along with Dragon, Wall, and Macho, spawn in Sexy Legs. Keep spawning these cats throughout the battle.

As your units attack the base, spawn in any other strong units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] for support. This stage shouldn't be much of a hassle.

